  "patch_packaging_note": "CS21A211I closes the missing fail-closed GET boundary in the existing QA staging guard. It preserves the Router's exact nine public GET selectors, validates QA Sheet/Drive IDs before dispatch, rejects ambiguous fn/action routing, keeps the no-fn branch as HtmlOutput, logs swallowed no-fn router errors without exposing traces, and exposes qa_get_guard_installed through getInfoGeneral for runtime evidence. The canonical guard is UTF-8/LF, 296 lines, 13062 bytes. The Apps Script index.html is a legacy secondary bundle: its PROD URL neutralization remains containment evidence, but the G/H render/Cronograma repairs are superseded as product work and are not acceptance criteria. getEstudiante remains default-deny. No PROD fallback, merge or new deployment is authorized by this manifest.",
